[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1020.31, "timestamp": "00:17:00", "text": "你已经陷得太深，无法自拔了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1021.55, "timestamp": "00:17:01", "text": "是的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1023.829, "timestamp": "00:17:03", "text": "就像我当时那样，我打算那样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1025.909, "timestamp": "00:17:05", "text": "这就像吸食可卡因一样，但我并不这么认为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1029.11, "timestamp": "00:17:09", "text": "我认为这适用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1031.59, "timestamp": "00:17:11", "text": "哎呀，我的比喻太糟糕了。是啊，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1033.189, "timestamp": "00:17:13", "text": "这就像一种成瘾行为，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1035.429, "timestamp": "00:17:15", "text": "你已经习惯的。所以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1038.029, "timestamp": "00:17:18", "text": "就像很难摆脱这种状态一样"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1039.112, "timestamp": "00:17:19", "author": "@LeverBoi", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xNxuxXmHi1c7fysDq7xCqQFkIHS14-WZ-pDk_WA0vJh_7H6RdN1zGFsbYrCE6izTRTxqZPdBqA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "this convo is getting too real"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1041.59, "timestamp": "00:17:21", "text": "呃，你所经历的磨难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1044.549, "timestamp": "00:17:24", "text": "你已经感觉像在自己的舒适区里一样了。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1047.11, "timestamp": "00:17:27", "text": "就像每当你试图……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1049.029, "timestamp": "00:17:29", "text": "起来，去尝试一些新的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1052.23, "timestamp": "00:17:32", "text": "你总是畏缩地退缩到你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1054.549, "timestamp": "00:17:34", "text": "了解而非探索远方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1057.909, "timestamp": "00:17:37", "text": "地平线类型的玩意儿。所以，是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1060.39, "timestamp": "00:17:40", "text": "当你像超级英雄一样的时候，这真的很难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1062.23, "timestamp": "00:17:42", "text": "陷入那种重复的怪圈，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1064.63, "timestamp": "00:17:44", "text": "知道？是的。好像你很享受似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1066.789, "timestamp": "00:17:46", "text": "就好像你没意识到这是个问题一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1068.87, "timestamp": "00:17:48", "text": "在那段时间里，它就……你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1071.029, "timestamp": "00:17:51", "text": "知道了，这正逐渐成为一种常态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1073.59, "timestamp": "00:17:53", "text": "你和其他一切都消失了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1076.47, "timestamp": "00:17:56", "text": "与此同时，它并没有真正变成什么样子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1079.669, "timestamp": "00:17:59", "text": "不再和你联系了。"}]